hat the item’s special purpose and dedicated powers are. these d% rolls are not modified by your caster level or any additional powdered gems you used to cast the spell.\\n\\nonce this spell ends, the item reverts to its previous nature—if you cast this spell on the item again, it gains entirely different powers as determined by a new set of rolls.\"",
